window.products.push({"id":1021071,"name":"ArtWall 'The Dance Foyer at The Opera on The Rue Le Peletier' Gallery-Wrapped Canvas Artwork by Edgar Degas, 24 by 32-Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.28,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71w7tWGKs8L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Edgar Degas 'After the Bath, Woman Drying her Neck' gallery-wrapped canvas is a high-quality canvas print in the Degas' trademark Impressionist style, depicting the figural curvature of his subject's back. An elegant, evocative addition to your home or office. Known to have influenced such great artists as Picasso and Matisse, Edgar Degas was an artist known as the \"painter of dancers\" who also worked at perfecting his skills in photography, lithography, oil paintings, pastels and etching. His innovations set the standards for Impressionists. He was especially intrigued by Parisian life, namely females, whether entertainment specialists, cabaret performers, or ballet dancers. When Edgar Degas returned to Paris, he found that he was tired of displaying his work in the Salon and joined more closely with a group of impressionists of the time. However, his paintings reveal an almost innate urge not to conform completely to all the whims of the day. His paintings of Absinthe and Dancers Practicing at the Bar are of particular note because of their real-world appeal. By his later years, he was dabbling in pastels, glazes and worked sculpting bronze.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71w7tWGKs8L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ArtWall","source_asin":"B00I2MW16O","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1021071","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00I2MW16O","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00I2MW16O","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1021072,"name":"Under Sink Organizer-1 Pack, Kitchen Organization, Cabinet Organizer with 2 Cups and 4 Hooks, Bathroom Organizer","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616CD2BKT-L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"【L Shape Under Sink Organizer】Different from other products, Our kitchen under sink organizers have different widths for the top drawer and bottom drawer, the top width is 5.32'' and the bottom width is 8.66''. The upper and lower sides of the storage boxes are supported by only 2 high-strength carbon steel pipes, which makes the storage effect more neat and tidy, the overall style more simple and fashionable. 【Made to Last】 The under sink organizer is made of ABS upper layer + PP plastic lower layer, the matte surface looks more advanced, good load-bearing performance and more solid; the 2 carbon steel load-bearing tubes have a rust-proof protective layer to further strengthen its use strength and extend its service life, so it can be applied to more humid environments. 【Easy to Install and Easy to Clean】 No need tools or screws, you can get a strong and stable under bathroom sink organizer; the under bathroom sink organizer comes with 2 hanging cups and 4 hooks to store some small parts, making effective use of limited space. The hollow design of the storage cabinet will not accumulate water, just wipe the surface with a damp cloth. 【Space Saving】This 2 tier under sink organizer will solve your under cabinet storage worries and improve the utilization of your limited sink space. The sliding design of the cabinet organizer can be effortlessly pulled out by the handle for easy access to items. Top and bottom sizes Different designs increase the flexibility of space utilization, and 4 hooks + 2 hanging cups, all for our convenience. 【More scene applications】It has a minimalist design style ,The bathroom under sink organizer can be used not only in the bathroom or under the kitchen cabinets, but also as a basic organizer in the office and bedroom, and can be applied to storage rooms, closets, laundry rooms and any other spaces, etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616CD2BKT-L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"chengchuang","source_asin":"B0BLVC5FF2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1021072","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BLVC5FF2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BLVC5FF2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
