window.products.push({"id":1021103,"name":"18PCS Mason Jar Vacuum Sealer Kit for foodsaver vacuum sealer,Vacuum Sealer jar attachment for Wide-Mouth & Regular-Mouth Mason-type jars.(with a Manu","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZOWgq7sdL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"UPGRADE ATTACHMENT WIDE COMPATIBLE : Dobetiny Jar sealing kit adopts 2 section food grade silicone pumping hose structure that can be used in the Vacuum machines with concave internal suction and the vacuum machine with convex external pumping interface. For the latter, connect our thick hose to the thin hose then connected to the convex rod vacuum nozzle (5.5mm-6mm), and your vacuum sealer can work. ALL IN ONE SET : This mason jar vacuum sealer kit comes with 1*Wide Mouth Sealer, 1*Regular Sealer, 2* Hose Connector (See the video on the detail page for details on how to use) 1*Manual Air Pump (for Manual Air Extraction), 1*User Guide, 6*Wide Mouth Mason Jar Lids(86mm), 6*Regular Mouth Mason Jar Lids(70mm), 1*can opener. PORTABLE VACUUM SEALER : vacuum sealer machine too big to carry around on a trip or picnic? Don't worry!!We offer you a manual pump that you can use to pump air out of the mason jars,It will be your portable and more affordable choice of vacuum sealer. EASY TO USE : Making sure the jar sealer is centered and pressed firmly over the lid of the canister, connect one end of the jar sealer hose to the machine's accessory port and the other end to the top of a lidded Mason jar, manual quickly extracts the air from the jar. About 5-7 times of manual pulling, the air can be exhausted to the sealing state. SAFE GREAT SERVICE : Vacuum sealer for jars is made of high-density ABS plastic, BPA free, non-toxic and odorless.Easy to clean by hand or in the dishwasher. Please read the user's manual before use. For any reason, if you are not completely satisfied for Dobetiny Sealer, please do not hesitate to contact us via the \"Contact Seller\" entrance on Amazon.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZOWgq7sdL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DobeTiny","source_asin":"B0B1Y69WXN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1021103","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B1Y69WXN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B1Y69WXN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
