window.products.push({"id":1021156,"name":"Pressed Aidigo Honey Willow-Herb Tea – Russian Pu-erh 8,8 oz","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41nLrVFigML._AC_.jpg","description":"Pressed willow herb tea is thought to be Russian Pu’er. Pressed willow herb tea leafs go through an additional fermentation stage, which improves its useful properties, so the drink acquires rich taste with deep honey shade and light fruit flavour. The more this tea ages, the better it gets. \"A-La Pu’er\" form and way of fermentation symbolizes wealth and good taste in China, so pressed willow herb tea will become an original surprise for your beloved ones and an exquisite gift to your business partners. One product combines the traditions of Russia and China, excellent taste and health benefits.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41nLrVFigML._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"willow herb","source_asin":"B01N0Z2QEK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1021156","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N0Z2QEK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N0Z2QEK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
