window.products.push({"id":1021273,"name":"Ultima Cosa Lighter, Electric Arc Lighter for Home Kitchen Candles Camping BBQ Stove, Bottle Opener, USB Rechargeable, Plasma Arc with LED Battery Dis","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZQ414kwvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【SAFETY PROTECTION】The candle lighter has overcharge and overheating protection design inside and double switch to ensure safety use.Continuous ignition for 7 seconds, the electric candle lighter will automatically power off. Remenber to push down the switch and make all LED lights turn off after use to save battery power for this electric lighter. This stick lighter has long neck to keep your hand away from dirty or burn yourself. It's a safe electronic lighter. 【BATTERY LEVEL DISPLAY 】Charging time is about 2 hours and lasts 400-500 times(real tested data when you can operate the candle lighter skillfully and ignite within 1 second after full charge).When you get your bbq lighter at the first time,charge it till 4 LED blue lights turn on,then the lighter can lasts longer.When the electric lighter only has 1 LED blue light turn on,you need to charge it in time. 【WINDPROOF & SPLASH PROOF】This candle lighter plasma is wind and splash proof. It's a electric USB lighter which is suitable for traveling and outdoor use.You can use the windproof lighter in your own backyard for your BBQ. our electric rechargeable lighter also works great for grills and fire pits.Get one for your next camping.And keep some pieces for your candles.The electric candle lighter is perfect for candles,bbq,grill,gas stoves,campfires,fireworks,fireplace,incense burners etc. 【 ECO FRIENDLY & CONVENIENT】Stop wasting time and money on the refilling lighter and disposable plastics.No more bad butane smell. This rechargeable grill lighter is your new choice. One time purchase to reuse this electric rechargeable lighter over and over again.It's windproof and flamess USB rechargeable lighter with a hook.Very suitable for traveling and outdoor use,ESPECIALLY for candles,gas stove,grills.This is a quality metal electric USB lighter.Get your cool candle lighter now. 【Easy to Store and Maintain】Never put electric lighter under the Sun and Splashing water. To Keep it in Clean and Dry Corner in Your Kitchen. We Provide Good Qualifying Item For Our Customers.When you have any issue with your lighter, please do not hesitate to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZQ414kwvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LONEA","source_asin":"B08YDCZ1LB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1021273","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08YDCZ1LB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08YDCZ1LB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
