window.products.push({"id":1021332,"name":"VIXEN CANDLES Vixen Candle Lets Stay Home Fruity & Tropical Scented Candle Banana & Pineapple Candle Gifts Women Aromatherapy Candle, Romantic Candles","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kcEEmqCGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Scented with luxurious perfumes and dressed in a sexy black vessel, every Vixen candle is fun, flirty and sultry. Our mission is to encourage you to unleash your inner vixen, and celebrate the goddess within you with confidence. Vixen Candles are made with 100% premium soy wax and luxurious perfumes poured into a sexy black vessel that radiates seductive elegance. Our unique label illustrations separate us from all other candle brands, and we think of each design as an original piece of artwork. Each and every Vixen candle celebrates a unique & sexy personality trait. Smell matters, your life matters, and your body matters. Today is the day to say YES to whatever makes you feel sexy! Vixen candles is not only about the mood shattering scents you smell with this gift, it is about feeling confident and knowing that everything you do feels good. So take a deep breath, and indulge yourself, you deserve it. Hand poured soy based candle made with natural cotton wicks, which make for optimum burning performance, producing the cleanest burn possible while the natural scented wax melts and burns evenly up to 50% longer than traditional candles. Our candles are so slow burning that each highly scented candle can last for over 70+ hours. We use top quality essential oils, fragrance oils, waxes, wicks and candle containers that are reusable, recyclable or refillable. These candles were designed for our customers with a refined taste and aesthetic sense who appreciate quality and consistency. These candles differ from other soy candles because they have carefully aligned slow burning cotton wicks within the soy wax candle container which helps maximize fire safety. PROUDLY MADE IN THE USA","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kcEEmqCGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VIXEN CANDLES","source_asin":"B09LTS6B5F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1021332","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09LTS6B5F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09LTS6B5F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
