window.products.push({"id":1021443,"name":"WANCLE Coffee Grinder Electric Coffee Mill with Smart Overheat Protection and Lid Safety Lock,Brushed Stainless Steel Housing Cleaner","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lw01LTNSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"WANCLE Electric Coffee Grinder A beautiful morning start from a cup of fresh coffee. The fresh coffee comes from WANCLE coffee grinder. Maybe you like fresh coffee but you’re afraid to purchase a grinder because of the following reasons: 1.Cheap quality. The blades are cheaply made, product made out of cheap plastic inside and outside that snapped in half. 2.Terrible design, waste your time and your beloved coffee beans. With some grinders you’ll never get uniform coarseness no matter how long you grind beans cause there are always a bunch of bean existing, you have to run it multiple times but there are still large chunks of coffee beans left. 3.Bad manufacturer. Have a high pitch screeching sound while grinding. As an Pioneer in developing of electric grinding product, WANCLE solves all the problems you worried about and won’t let you down! From the blades, bean-house to the entire body, WANCLE coffee grinder uses the safest and most solid food-grade Stainless Steel, will offer you the best grinding experience and let you use at ease. Top design and great craftsmanship make the exquisite machine look like an Artwork. To The coffee beans will be grind to standard you wish. Also because of the excellent manufacture the machine is very silent while working. You never have chance to get unevenly coarse or experience a weird sound from the machine.  The built-in intelligent overheating protection will protect product; Excellent bottom heat dispersion can effectively extend service life of grinder. Operating with only one button let you use at ease, just press and you’ll enjoy a cup of coffee in seconds. Transparent cover let you clearly know about the grinding coarseness at any time. The little brush make the thorough cleansing incredibly easy! Large grinding capacity could grind up to 4 to 6 cups of coffee one time. Stainless Steel blades that can grind not only coffee beans but also spices, herbs, nuts, grains and more. A cup of freshly ground coffee is the switch to start a busy travel day, it's also a good medicine for fatigue after a day of full itinerary. The mobile phone needs to be charged, so as people. If you feel tired, try to grind coffee for yourself, you’ll forget all the issues at that moment. Travel with WANCLE Portable Coffee Grinder, you’ll enjoy fresh ground coffee beans indoors, outdoors, or anywhere in the world. SPECIFICATIONS: Wattage: 150 W  Material: All Food-grade Stainless Steel Housing, silicone Transparent Cover Size: 110 * 103 * 186 mm  Power Input: 120V, 60Hz Capacity: 1.8 oz (50 g) Weigh: 26.5 oz (750 g) Size: 3.62*3.62*6.89 Inch (9.20*9.20*17.51 CM) Package list: 1*Coffee Grinder, 1*Instruction, 1*Brush Cleaner","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lw01LTNSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wancle","source_asin":"B000ITTCMU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1021443","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000ITTCMU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000ITTCMU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
