window.products.push({"id":1021662,"name":"JRAP Large Silicone Ice Bucket, Ice Cube Maker (2 in 1), Ice Freezer Tray with lid, Round, Portable, Reusable, For Frozen Whiskey, Cocktails, Beverage","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61sfNATBWhS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Design: The large 2 in 1 ice buckets and ice making molds can be used to store up to 120 ice cubes and keep your beverage ice cold. Unique two-compartment design: An outer compartment for frozen ice, while an inner compartment for storage ice is large enough to share with family and friends. How to Use: First open the pack containing the two trays and remove the inner plastic container. Next, add 1 cup of water and press down firmly on the inner plastic bin. NOTE: ***Please make sure to press hard*** Place the lid back on the ice bucket and place vertically in the freezer for at least 4 hours. After freezing, remove the inner plastic ring and squeeze the silicone container for mini small crushed ice nugget and enjoy! You may repeat this process up to 3 times. Wide range of uses: Great for tail-gating at college footballs games, dinners, parties, picnics and beaches! Provides longer cooling times for bottled beverages such as wine bottles, cocktail, beers, whisky and sodas. Also works perfectly for keeping ice cream and other desserts cold. Portable: Ideal for outdoor and indoor use! This is great for camping and picnics where you need an ice cold drink to feel refreshed again! Great for ice storage in the freezer without taking much space with a great stackable design. Safety: Completely BPA free and safe to eat ball shaped ice rocks! Enjoy your drinks like champagne, bourbon or other cocktails. Plenty to share with family and friends!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61sfNATBWhS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JRAP","source_asin":"B094F5Y339","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1021662","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B094F5Y339","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B094F5Y339","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
