window.products.push({"id":1021843,"name":"13\" Stainless Steel Non-Stick Rolling Pin and 6\" Dough Cutter/Scraper Bundle for Baking - Best for Fondant, Pie Crust, Cookie, Pastry, Pasta, Pizza Do","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51YyQq5O0-L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Whether you are making dough for cookies, pizza, or anything in between, our lightweight and non-stick rolling pin and dough cutter are the best baking companions. Made with food-grade stainless steel, they are easy to use, very sanitary, and easy to clean.  With their elegant colors and design, this pair will surely be a great addition to your kitchen! Package includes the dough-namic duo: 13\" Stainless Steel Rolling Pin 13\" Stainless Steel Rolling Pin 6\" Dough Scraper/Cutter 6\" Dough Scraper/Cutter DURABLE AND SANITARY Made of high-quality, food-grade stainless steel, our rolling pin and scraper are built to last.  They do not absorb colors, odors, or flavors, rust, or grow molds or mildew, making them hygienic and safe. EASY TO USE Unlike ordinary rolling pins with handles, ours is tapered, lightweight, and non-stick, making it easier to control and maneuver. EASY TO CLEAN and MAINTAIN Unlike wooden rolling pins which require regular oiling maintenance, ours is completely maintenance-free. Its smooth and seamless design means there are no crevices where dough or flour can get stuck in. Wash them easily with soap and water and they are good to go! They are dishwasher-safe too. KEEPS DOUGH COOL Chill our rolling pin inside the fridge or freezer before use and feel your dough stay cool while you work 'em out! MULTI-PURPOSE Perfect for any kind of sweet or savory dough! Even play-doh! :) We honestly think you'll love our baking duo! But if you find something else better, we will gladly give you a full refund - no hassles, no questions asked.  Have fun baking and stay safe!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51YyQq5O0-L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TCS","source_asin":"B08J18VGZ9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1021843","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08J18VGZ9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08J18VGZ9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
