window.products.push({"id":1021992,"name":"LiTrend Sofa Slipcover Reversible Sofa Cover Water Resistant Couch Cover Furniture Protector with Elastic Straps for Pets Kids Children Dog Cat","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LYw8Fc7NL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SUITBLE FOR VARIOUS SOFA TYPES - Seat Width: (XL Sofa) up to 78\", (Sofa) up to 68\", (Loveseat Oversized) up to 54\", (Loveseat) up to 46\", (Recliner Oversized) up to 30\", (Recliner) up to 23\", (Chair) up to 23\". See MEASURING GUIDE in photos. SEARCH FOR MORE SIZES IN OUR SHOP. SUPER DURABLE 3-LAYERS QUILTED FABRIC: Quilted from tear-resistant Microfiber fabric (polyester composition), this durable sofa furniture cover is composed of 3 layers with thick poly foam filling for extra comfort & softness. Features a sanitized protective finish and odor prevent to keep your furniture looking and smelling fragrant. Chemicals free and ECO friendly, high safety to kids and pets. ULTIMATE PROTECTION: Durable tear-resistant cover is designed to protect your furniture from everyday wear; perfect for homes with kids and pets; quilted cover helps keep pet hair, dirt and messes off of your furniture; long side flaps help to protect hard to clean arms; cover is easy to install and remove when entertaining guests. THE REVERSIBLE SOFA COVER THAT STAYS IN PLACE: Our sofa couch cover for dogs and pets features a reversible design (dual color) perfect to frequently update your sofa’s look at no extra cost. Our non-slip sofa furniture slip covers also feature non slip foam anchors and Feature elastic straps to guarantee they will stay tight with no snag, no wrinkling, shifting or slipping even after sitting or taking a nap on it. CARE AND MAINTENANCE: Just toss this piece in the washing machine for effortless upkeep. Separately in cold water on the gentle cycle. Do not use on furniture treated with additives, cleaners, or conditioners, they may react with the PVC backing and result in damage to your furniture. We stand behind all of our high quality products so we offer a 6 months No Question Asked on all our sofa protectors. Please contact us and we will be pleased to assist you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LYw8Fc7NL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LiTrend","source_asin":"B09MHY7J7F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1021992","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09MHY7J7F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09MHY7J7F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
